  "message": "Make the Windows unreadable fixture privilege-proof\n\nThe hosted Windows runner can bypass a deny ACE when Go opens a directory with backup intent, so the DACL fixture did not make the directory unreadable. Hold a read handle with zero sharing instead: later directory opens fail with a native sharing violation regardless of ACL privileges. Assert the fixture's listing boundary directly before comparing both fingerprint implementations."
